    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Rdgai: Classifying transcriptional changes using Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> with a test case from an Arabic Gospel tradition
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Turnbull%2C+R">Robert Turnbull</a>
      
