    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Can Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> Function as Qualified Pediatricians? A Systematic Evaluation in Real-World Clinical Contexts
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
