    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MM-Telco: Benchmarks and Multimodal Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Telecom Applications
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
